{"base_rate":0.805168986083499,"brier":0.16308866799204771,"bss":-0.03962964978584016,"bss_hi":0.03857032884943029,"bss_lo":-0.14151562759341088,"chart":{"base":[1106.0,80.6],"lead":"62,288 272,275.6 482,275.1 692,267","note":{"base":"skill -0.04 — higher than 11% of cities","lead":"day-1 error 0.8 °C — better than 97% of cities","rel":"promised 52% → rained 64%; promised 100% → rained 90%"},"rel":"392.7,191.5 579.7,139.7 652.2,122.4 689.9,76.2"},"country":"BN","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve"],"ece":0.10151093439363817,"ess":465.24081413686895,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Bandar Seri Begawan</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Bandar Seri Begawan rain forecast is cannot beat its own climatology, though 3 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (100%), believe about\n<b>90%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(39%), there is still roughly a <b>61%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 503 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-03-12. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 6.1 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score -0.04, ranked 190 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(181&ndash;198) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>39%</td><td class='num'><b>61%</b></td><td class='num'>51</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>67%</td><td class='num'><b>67%</b></td><td class='num'>45</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>79%</td><td class='num'><b>70%</b></td><td class='num'>53</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>87%</td><td class='num'><b>83%</b></td><td class='num'>41</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>92%</td><td class='num'><b>75%</b></td><td class='num'>59</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>96%</td><td class='num'><b>90%</b></td><td class='num'>29</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>100%</td><td class='num'><b>90%</b></td><td class='num'>225</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">3 of 7 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Bandar Seri Begawan</b> <span class=\"muted\">Brunei</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag bad\">Cannot beat climatology</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">3 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>-0.04</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>181&ndash;198\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>503 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Bandar Seri Begawan &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Bandar Seri Begawan\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text c